  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tbsp of oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion, ginger, and garlic and sauté until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the eggplant and cook until it starts to soften.",
    "Add the peas, cauliflower, curry powder, garam masala, and salt. Stir well to combine.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and stir to coat all the vegetables.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Stir in the yogurt and lime juice. ",
    "Serve hot, garnished with nuts or seeds if desired.",
    "Adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve immediately.",
    "Store leftovers in an airtight container in the refrigerator for up to 3 days or freeze for up to 2 months.",
    "Thaw frozen korma overnight in the refrigerator and reheat in the microwave or on the stovetop until hot and steaming."
